title: Clipboard command written silently or wiped
severity: medium
score: 25
tags: clickfix
attack: T1204.004, T1070
description: The page wrote a shell-like command to the clipboard with no user gesture, or
  overwrote or blanked a command it wrote earlier. ClickFix kits do both. Copy buttons on
  documentation pages do neither.
---
union
    // A clipboard command written with no click behind it ...
    (clipboard_commands
     | where user_activation == false
     | project how = "written without a click", text = substring(text, 0, 1000), frame_url),
    // ... or a command the page blanked or replaced afterwards.
    (overwritten_commands
     | project how = "blanked or replaced", text = substring(prev_plain, 0, 1000), frame_url)
